{"id":"vod_hh_31158","vodId":"31158","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"娜娜","name_cn":"娜娜","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第50集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/5ac93bfefcaa86acb77acbefd55d659a.jpg"},"summary":"大崎娜娜（朴璐美 配音），心怀音乐梦的朋克女青年，曾在家乡和男友本城莲（木内秀信 配音）、好友高木泰（川原庆久 配音）、寺岛伸夫（关智一 配音）合组乐队Black Stones，后因莲被当红乐队Trapnest挖角到东京发展，二人被迫分手。时隔两年，娜娜也决定前往东京，  找来泰和伸夫重整Black Stones旗鼓，誓要和莲的Trapnest一拼高下。小松奈奈（KAORI 配音），永远沉浸在恋爱梦中的不靠谱小镇姑娘，因男友远藤章司（高桥广树 配音）到东京求学备受异地恋煎熬，而今终于有机会移居东京陪伴章司。两个名字发音同为“nana”的女孩相遇在去往东京的新干线上，又十分凑巧地看重同一间“707”号公寓，二人决定合租。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-05-30 17:01:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/negMm5Gb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGW3v8d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ZdPW311b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGW3ZLd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQg900d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2DKv1e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4GMRVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/xboXxQ3d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepLygpe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/zbqLzYGa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepLyQpe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0DGgye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8KQ6ga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Le3VLlOd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/0dNW3xDe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVn3mve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://pla